{"unit_id": "script_0134", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 134}, "text": "- Pre-training has 4 stages (train adapter, train all parameters on 8K, 32K, 256K lengths)", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0135", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 135}, "text": "- Post-training: SFT on long CoT data, knowledge distillation, RL", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
