{"unit_id": "script_0137", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 137}, "text": "- SOTA performance", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0138", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 138}, "text": "- Lots of data work, but not many details", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0139", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 139}, "text": "- Minor but potentially important architectural improvements", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0140", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 140}, "text": "- Scale up", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0141", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 141}, "text": "So far: VLMs encode images (via CLIP or SigLIP), inject into LM", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0142", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 142}, "text": "Disadvantage: can't generate images (need diffusion)", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0143", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 143}, "text": "Chameleon: map everything into discrete tokens", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0144", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 144}, "text": "Advantage: can analyze and generate images in a uniform way", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0145", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 145}, "text": "- Key difference: encoder needs to map to discrete tokens (so we can generate them)", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0146", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 146}, "text": "- Idea: map image to a discrete codebook, decode back to image and minimize reconstruction loss", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0147", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 147}, "text": "- Encodes 512 x 512 image into 1024 tokens (codebook of size 8192)", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0148", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 148}, "text": "- Train a new BPE tokenizer", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0149", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 149}, "text": "Training:", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0150", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 150}, "text": "- Stage 1 (80%): large-scale, unsupervised (2.9T text tokens, 1.5T text/image tokens, 400B text/image interleaved tokens)", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0151", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 151}, "text": "- Stage 2 (20%): 50% of stage 1 data, 50% of high quality data", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0152", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 152}, "text": "Training stability", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0153", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 153}, "text": "- Text tokens have low entropy, image tokens have high entropy, leads to norm growth, logit drift problem", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0154", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 154}, "text": "- Fixes: QK norm, z-loss regularization", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0155", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 155}, "text": "Summary:", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0156", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 156}, "text": "- Elegant (just autoregressive modeling of discrete tokens)", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0157", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 157}, "text": "- Not as performant (discretization loses information - think OCR)", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
{"unit_id": "script_0158", "source_type": "official_executable_lecture_block", "source_id": "lecture_17.py", "loc": {"block": 158}, "text": "- Training with multiple modalities is tricky", "asset_path": null, "required": true}
